<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In MedFact: Benchmarking the Fact-Checking Capabilities of Large Language Models on Chinese Medical Texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Complete Experimental Results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SSx1" title="In Appendix D Complete Experimental Results ‣ MedFact: Benchmarking the Fact-Checking Capabilities of Large Language Models on Chinese Medical Texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Full Result Tables</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SSx2" title="In Appendix D Complete Experimental Results ‣ MedFact: Benchmarking the Fact-Checking Capabilities of Large Language Models on Chinese Medical Texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Fine-grained Performance</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A4.SSx3" title="In Appendix D Complete Experimental Results ‣ MedFact: Benchmarking the Fact-Checking Capabilities of Large Language Models on Chinese Medical Texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Data Contamination</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In MedFact: Benchmarking the Fact-Checking Capabilities of Large Language Models on Chinese Medical Texts" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Case Studies</span></a></li>
